---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout currentPath="/">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
    <div>
      <h1 class="py-2 text-2xl font-semibold">Keez Eden</h1>
      <p>
        Im a software developer who enjoys solving difficult problems and pride myself in being able to do it quickly.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h1 class="py-2 text-2xl font-semibold">When</h1>
      <p>
        I've been tinkering with technology since I was 4 years old, but started programming in 2015 and working
        professionally in 2018
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h1 class="py-2 text-2xl font-semibold">Where</h1>
      <p>I'm based in Napier, New Zealand</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h1 class="py-2 text-2xl font-semibold">Why</h1>
      <p>
        I love puzzles and am highly competitive, meaning once I find a problem that interests me, I do not let go until
        its solved. Software and Technology allows me to have access to and solve a wide range of challenges.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
